href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" href=\"?note=b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" title=\"17-df-algebraic-closure\">17-df-algebraic-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1ceb182c9aa75eb2\" href=\"?note=1ceb182c9aa75eb2\" title=\"17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange\">17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.2.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)\">\\(D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d88aa28a0fcc379a\" href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acl},\\operatorname{cl},\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Basis}\">\\(\\operatorname{acl},\\operatorname{cl},\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Basis}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" href=\"?note=b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" title=\"17-df-algebraic-closure\">17-df-algebraic-closure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>。在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a> 中工作。交换律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1ceb182c9aa75eb2\" href=\"?note=1ceb182c9aa75eb2\" title=\"17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange\">17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange</a>。下式先断言基的存在与等势，再定义单值的基数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)\">\\(\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)\\)</span>；无基参数记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\">\\(\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)\">\\(D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)\\)</span> 时定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall X,Y\\subseteq D\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(Y)\\to |X|=|Y|\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists!\\kappa\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land|X|=\\kappa)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)=\\kappa\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land|X|=\\kappa),\\\\\nD\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)\n&amp;\\to\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D):=\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,\\varnothing}(D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall X,Y\\subseteq D\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(Y)\\to |X|=|Y|\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists!\\kappa\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land|X|=\\kappa)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)=\\kappa\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists X\\subseteq D\\;(\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\\land|X|=\\kappa),\\\\\nD\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)\n&amp;\\to\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D):=\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,\\varnothing}(D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代数闭包具有有限特征；在强极小假设下，交换律给出预几何。在选择公理下将独立集延长为极大独立集得到基；交换论证保证任意两个基等势。这里将维数所需的存在、单值性写入 Assertion，而非仅放在说明文字中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set","status":"resolved","id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-algebraic-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b93c3fbca33bcd2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep